  "known_remaining_failure": "Even after a fresh read, identical-token external saves are indistinguishable from an unchanged entry. The stale process still admits retirement and deletes that fixture entry. Both normal and sanitized receipts retain this failure. There is also no atomic read/compare/delete interval protecting a new write after a read.",
